    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ensemble of heroes stumble into a creaky room, seemingly unguarded. They notice a silhouette in the dark room; linen cloth draped over a large object. They remove the cloth revealing a strange device of metal gizmos and gadgets. Upon the press of the button &amp; the flick of a switch, the heroes are drawn into the device, emerging as shorter...stubbier versions of themselves.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Pinball Hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a reimagining of the Pinball genre, mixed with rogue-lite elements. Bump, hack &amp; slash enemy bumpers with your Pinball Hero. Acquire new items and explore mysterious dungeons. Though a hero may fall in battle many times; determination, skill and powerful artifacts will ensure that future attempts to reclaim your hero spirit are successful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bump, bop and bash a multitude of <strong>enemies and bosses</strong>, inspired by retro and contemporary fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/fcea4cf688c98d18088ee159a154814b.poster.avif?t=1755403953\" width=542 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/fcea4cf688c98d18088ee159a154814b.webm?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/fcea4cf688c98d18088ee159a154814b.mp4?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your backpack to the brim with over <strong>100 unique items</strong> that automatically trigger to augment your pinball battle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/00637f983963b5dbfea2aefefee948da.poster.avif?t=1755403953\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/00637f983963b5dbfea2aefefee948da.webm?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/00637f983963b5dbfea2aefefee948da.mp4?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against Grubfoot the cheeky goblin merchant in 5 retro inspired <strong>minigames</strong>, including plinko, slots, cards &amp; more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/bd7ca67b27bf76aaaa3561c8364e98bb.poster.avif?t=1755403953\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/bd7ca67b27bf76aaaa3561c8364e98bb.webm?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/bd7ca67b27bf76aaaa3561c8364e98bb.mp4?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your Pinball Heroes legendary by augmenting them with rare and\u00a0<strong>powerful loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/a5d4f221c9c468e0d6cf0026ebc2a6e3.poster.avif?t=1755403953\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/a5d4f221c9c468e0d6cf0026ebc2a6e3.webm?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/a5d4f221c9c468e0d6cf0026ebc2a6e3.mp4?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove out to a full <strong>OST of unique 8-bit bangers</strong>, passionately crafted by the Devs &amp; New Zealand talent, Jonny Dyas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/af198abde212dbcc23caccef07bf0708.poster.avif?t=1755403953\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/af198abde212dbcc23caccef07bf0708.webm?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009440/extras/af198abde212dbcc23caccef07bf0708.mp4?t=1755403953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
